sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor F as Family member
  participant W as Web app
  participant A as API (WS /visits/stream)
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant T as Muse Voice Transcribe
  participant M as Muse Spark 1.3
  F->>W: Tap "Record visit"
  W->>F: Show consent screen (doctor and patient)
  F->>W: Confirm both consents
  W->>A: POST /visits with consent details
  A->>D: consents x2, visits row (needs both consent ids)
  W->>A: Stream audio (WebSocket)
  A->>T: PCM 16 kHz, DIARIZATION mode
  T-->>A: Turns with speaker A, B, C
  A->>D: transcript_segments (partials replaced by finals)
  F->>W: Stop recording
  A->>M: Transcript: map speakers to roles
  M-->>A: A=doctor, B=patient, C=daughter
  A->>D: visit_speakers (mapped_by model)
  W->>F: Confirm or correct who is who
  A->>M: Transcript + schema: instructions, medicines, tests, follow-ups, allergies
  M-->>A: Items with the doctor's exact words
  A->>A: Check each quote appears in a transcript segment
  A->>D: plan_changes (pending, needs confirmation)
  W->>F: Review list: confirm or reject each change
  F->>W: Confirm
  A->>D: Apply as new versions, audit rows, then delete audio if set
  A->>M: Explain in the patient's language
  A->>W: Spoken explanation for Papa that evening
